{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46221","headline":"陪冯使君游六首 迎仙阁 · 贯休","name":"陪冯使君游六首 迎仙阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"涧香霞影遶楼台，卷箔凭阑耳目开。\n况从旌旗近鸾凤，可怜谈笑出尘埃。\n火云不入长松径，露茗何须白玉杯。\n谁道迎仙仙不至，今朝还有谢公来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}